# CI/local build scratch. The firmware workflow uses audit/ as its working
# directory and fills it with generated artifacts -- zephyr.elf, the .map,
# stemtape_player.bin, nm.txt, a copy of the sources, and every host test
# binary it compiles. Building those host tests locally (the playback gate,
# its ThreadSanitizer build, the ring-depth sweep) drops the same binaries
# here. None of it is source and none of it belongs in the repository.
audit/
firmware/stemtape_player/tests/scratch_apply_block.inc
